@startuml domain-accounts
title Accounts, roles and regular groups

top to bottom direction
hide empty members
hide circle
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<AggregateRoot>> #DBEAFE
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<ValueObject>> #DCFCE7
skinparam classBackgroundColor<<RoleView>> #F3E8FF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40

class Booker <<RoleView>> {
  +userId : UUID
  --
  +createSession(...) : Session
  +cancel(...) : FinancialResult
  +changeVisibility(...) : void
  +removeParticipant(...) : FinancialResult
  +verifyAttendance(...) : void
  +prepareSettlement(...) : SettlementBatch [0..1]
}

class Participant <<RoleView>> {
  +userId : UUID
  --
  +join(...) : AdmissionResult
  +leaveWaitlist(...) : void
  +withdraw(...) : WithdrawalResult
  +offerReplacementToWaitlist(...) : FinancialResult
}

class User <<AggregateRoot>> {
  +userId : UUID
  +accountStatus : AccountStatus
  +reliabilityScore : ReliabilityScore
  +memberGroupIds : UUID[]
  --
  {static} +create(...) : User
  +updateProfile(...) : void
  +updatePreferences(...) : void
  +beginPayoutSetup(...) : void
  +payoutDestination() : PayoutDestination
  +asBooker() : Booker
  +asParticipant() : Participant
  +deactivate(...) : void
}

class Wallet <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +walletId : UUID
  +userId : UUID
  --
  +getFunds() : Money
}

class Email <<ValueObject>> {
  +toString() : string
  +equals(...) : boolean
}

class PayoutAccount <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +payoutAccountId : UUID
  +userId : UUID
  +setupStatus : PayoutSetupStatus
  --
  +completeSetup(...) : PayoutAccount
  +failSetup() : PayoutAccount
}

class RegularGroup <<AggregateRoot>> {
  +groupId : UUID
  +ownerId : UUID
  +name : string
  +status : GroupStatus
  +invitationActive : boolean
  --
  {static} +create(...) : RegularGroup
  +join(...) : GroupJoinResult
  +removeMember(...) : void
  +rotateInvitation(...) : void
  +archive(...) : void
}

class GroupMembership <<ImmutableChild>> {
  +userId : UUID
  +joinedAt : Date
}

Booker "0..*" -down-> "1" User : wraps
Participant "0..*" -down-> "1" User : wraps
User "1" *-down- "1" Wallet : wallet
User "1" *-down- "0..1" PayoutAccount : payoutAccount
User -down-> "0..1" Email : email
RegularGroup "1" *-down- "1..*" GroupMembership : memberships

User -[hidden]right- RegularGroup
Wallet -[hidden]right- Email
Email -[hidden]right- PayoutAccount

caption Selected public members; (...) abbreviates parameters.\nBooker and Participant own role decisions; Session owns its lifecycle and roster.\nWallet uses committed ledger history; reliability and group IDs are loaded related values.
@enduml
